#: ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.description
msgid ""
"UZ Core profile for Stores and represents the National Immunization Schedule "
"of Uzbekistan, including planned vaccines, recommended administration "
"periods, target age groups, dose sequences, and related scheduling rules. "
"This profile is used to define structured immunization activities that "
"support consistent planning, implementation, and exchange of vaccination "
"schedules within the national digital health ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"UZ Core profili O‘zbekistonning Milliy vaksinatsiya jadvalini saqlash va "
"ifodalash uchun mo‘ljallangan bo‘lib, unga rejalashtirilgan vaksinalar, "
"tavsiya etilgan yuborish davrlari, maqsadli yosh guruhlari, doza ketma-"
"ketliklari va tegishli rejalashtirish qoidalari kiradi. Ushbu profil milliy "
"raqamli sog‘liqni saqlash ekotizimi doirasida vaksinatsiya jadvallarini "
"izchil rejalashtirish, amalga oshirish va almashishni qo‘llab-quvvatlaydigan "
"strukturaviy vaksinatsiya faoliyatlarini belgilash uchun ishlatiladi."

